1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,530
M: I can't believe this, but I managed to book a ticket to Singapore.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,110
I will be on the seven o'clock flight tomorrow morning.

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:08,490
W: That's great.

4
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:14,530
Does that mean that you will get to see your friend who moved out there a few years back after you are finished meeting with Mr. Wang?

5
00:00:15,075 --> 00:00:21,185
M: I am not sure because Mr. Wang will probably want to take me around the plant site on the day I arrive there.

6
00:00:21,835 --> 00:00:28,210
I am hoping that I will be able to see my friend the day after, but he mentioned that he might have to leave town that day.

7
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:33,950
He said he would try to rearrange his trip, but I have not spoken to him for a few days.

8
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,530
I will call him tonight to see if he is able to do that.

9
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:42,930
W: You should just take your vacation early and spend a week there after you take care of your business.

10
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,250
It's not like you get to travel to the Far East all the time, you know.
